- relevant AI usage register

Document clearly:

- consumer-self usage endpoint;
- administrator per-consumer usage endpoint;
- authorization difference between them;
- UTC/window/grouping semantics;
- privacy/security boundaries.

Do not describe the feature as deployed until deployment has actually occurred.

==================================================
QUALITY / VERIFICATION
==================================================

Run all relevant checks.

At minimum:

- Prettier / formatting
- backend lint
- frontend lint
- contracts lint/typecheck if applicable
- backend typecheck
- frontend typecheck
- focused backend tests
- database usage tests if affected
- focused frontend tests
- full affected workspace tests
- OpenAPI lint
