- repository-wide npm run check / ci:local where practical according to current project docs

If a repository-wide check fails because of an unrelated pre-existing/environmental issue:

- show the exact command;
- show where it failed;
- determine whether the affected test passes independently;
- do not change unrelated code merely to force green;
- do not claim the full check passed.

==================================================
SECURITY REVIEW BEFORE COMPLETION
==================================================

Before declaring the implementation ready, explicitly verify:

- no raw API key appears in administrator usage responses;
- no raw key is needed by the frontend;
- no hash is exposed;
- no request headers/bodies/payloads are exposed;
